# Work Out ↔ session detail sync

Today’s log and a past day’s log stay identical for:

- set rows (`W` / `01`, edit/delete, last-row border) — `LoggedSetRows`
- delete-sheet preview — `toDeletableSet`
- warm-up reference weight when opening add-set — `loadReferenceWeightByExerciseId`

Do not copy these into one screen. Exercise headers may differ (History shows % change; today does not).
